# Store text as LF in the repository; check out with native endings is left to each
# contributor's git config. A batch of commits once converted ~20 files to CRLF,
# which made every later diff of them unreadable.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.glb binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
